            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582782,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Legal Concerns</strong><br>\nThere were numerous legal concerns regarding the construction of the wall. Many argued that the wall violated international law. In 2004, the International Court of Justice declared the construction of the wall along the planned route to be illegal. Nevertheless, the construction of the wall continued.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Other Barriers to Peace</strong><br>\nIn addition to the wall, there are many other barriers to peace. The ongoing occupation, settlement policies, and military actions of both sides hinder the peace process. Deep-seated hostilities and mistrust further complicate the situation.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Hope for Resolution</strong><br>\nDespite the challenges, there is still hope for a resolution of the conflict. Various peace initiatives have been proposed, and there are people on both sides working for peaceful coexistence. However, the path to reconciliation is long and requires the will and effort of all parties involved.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "3d655444-fd55-42f7-aba2-16a16db7dc58"
